        <localActions>
            <fullName>analyze_headroom_179We000000q4xD</fullName>
            <description>Governed Headroom aggregation for a single country + program. Resolves a Headroom category/program (Core Program, Rural Retail, Market Access, Trees, System Change Extension, Unrestricted, Working Capital) to its Budget Line population and SUMS all governed fields across every qualifying line for the country and fiscal year. Returns TWO renderings: &apos;summary&apos; — a concise, conversational business answer (the default to show) — and &apos;detail&apos; — the full field-by-field breakdown (show only when the user asks). Returns found=true with a governed result, a governed zero for Unrestricted/Working Capital, or found=false when the category is not configured, no qualifying lines exist, or the category/country is missing.</description>
